          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusukela osukwini oyihlo abaphuma ngalo ezweni laseGibithe kuze kube namuhla, ngithuma kini zonke izinceku zami abaprofethi, ngivuka ekuseni imihla ngemihla ngibathuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
